{"c":[{"name":"20261002T143157Z-06f3c5b5c6254f49","text":"A value shown in two windows is credited by RollingText.find to the most recently seen one; pattern code must use findAll and pick the window that explains every round, or loop columns look like different sources.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T143157Z-9c4a82917dc22e00","text":"Replaying reader streams in tests: tick helper on a fixed 250 ms grid of stream time like main.ts; ticking only inside gaps >250 ms delays every transfer when messages are dense.","type":"note"}]}
